## Common Patterns

### 1. Real-time Data Sync
```kotlin
// Use Flow for real-time updates
firestoreDataSource.getUsers().collect { result ->
    when (result) {
        is NetworkResult.Success -> updateUI(result.data)
        is NetworkResult.Error -> handleError(result.message)
    }
}
```

### 2. Image Upload
```kotlin
